{"id":"5385f3fe07cb98ef","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free Variable","display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-free-variable","aliases":["90-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","depends_on":["[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-base-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b24fa26209f44674\" href=\"?note=b24fa26209f44674\" title=\"90-df-base-free-variable\">90-df-base-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\operatorname{ar}\">\\(L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\operatorname{ar}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}\">\\(\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b24fa26209f44674\" href=\"?note=b24fa26209f44674\" title=\"90-df-base-free-variable\">90-df-base-free-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_L\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(R)=n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>；等式原子一行的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,t_2\">\\(t_1,t_2\\)</span> 独立遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> 是下式引入的同一变量集合函数的本书短名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{var}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(t_1=t_2)&amp;=\\operatorname{var}(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(t_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&amp;=\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{var}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(t_1=t_2)&amp;=\\operatorname{var}(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(t_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&amp;=\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\)</span> : 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中所有自由出现的变量集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}(t)\\)</span> : 项<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>中出现的变量集合</li>\n<li>自由变量是不被量词约束的变量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-base-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b24fa26209f44674","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-base-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\operatorname{ar}$ 见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_L$ 见 [[90-df-formula]]；$\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$、$\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$ 见 [[90-df-base-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\operatorname{ar}$ 见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_L$ 见 [[90-df-formula]]；$\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$、$\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$ 见 [[90-df-base-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-base-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b24fa26209f44674","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\operatorname{ar}$ 见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_L$ 见 [[90-df-formula]]；$\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$、$\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$ 见 [[90-df-base-free-variable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\operatorname{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(R)=n","display":false},{"tex":"t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"t_1,t_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{var}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}&:\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_L),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(t_1=t_2)&=\\operatorname{var}(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{var}(t_2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&=\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\varphi)&=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall x\\varphi)&=\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":1778,"backlinks":[{"id":"c61fe71286984490","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 及对象语言 $\\le$ 取 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]]；变量、项、公式、$\\mathrm{Distinct}$、有限量词列及 $\\operatorname{var}$ 取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]、[[90-df-formula]]、[[90-df-free-variable]]。"},{"id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k$；$\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，$\\operatorname{var}$ 取 [[90-df-free-variable]]。$\\overline{\\vec n}$ 是下式定义的对象项有限列，不是元语言自然数列本身。"},{"id":"4c3a40ac2277e7d0","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FV}$ 见 [[90-df-free-variable]]